# AI Healthcare Chatbot Documentation

## 1. Project Overview

The AI Healthcare Chatbot is a web-based application designed to assist users with preliminary medical inquiries using natural language processing. It supports multiple languages and speech input, offering a more inclusive and accessible healthcare experience.

---

## 2. Key Features

* AI-powered chatbot for medical symptom checking
* Multilingual support: English, Hindi, Tamil, Telugu
* Text and speech input support
* Real-time response with voice output
* Session-based chat history
* Light and dark UI themes

---

## 3. Technology Stack

**Frontend:**

* HTML, CSS, JavaScript
* Bootstrap, Font Awesome for UI

**Backend:**

* Python 3.11 (Flask Framework)
* OpenAI (for AI responses)
* gTTS (Google Text-to-Speech)

**APIs & Tools:**

* Web Speech API (browser-based voice recognition)

**Deployment:**

* Docker (Python 3.11-slim image)

