## 5. Setup Instructions

### Local Setup

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/ai-healthcare-chatbot.git
cd ai-healthcare-chatbot
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```

Visit: [http://localhost:5000](http://localhost:5000)

### Docker Setup

```bash
docker build -t ai-healthcare-chatbot .
docker run -d -p 5050:5050 --name chatbot ai-healthcare-chatbot
```

Visit: [http://localhost:5050](http://localhost:5050)

---

## 6. Dockerfile Overview

* Uses Python 3.11 slim image
* Installs necessary system dependencies
* Copies requirements and installs Python packages
* Sets working directory and runs Flask app on port 5050
* Uses a non-root user `appuser` for security

---

## 7. API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint                 | Description                   |
| ------ | ------------------------ | ----------------------------- |
| POST   | `/chat`                  | Send user message             |
| GET    | `/get_history`           | Retrieve session chat history |
| GET    | `/get_all_conversations` | List all chat sessions        |
| POST   | `/clear_chatbox`         | Clear current chat history    |

